<title>USA: Morrison Knudsen gets $11 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Morrison Knudsen gets $11 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Knudsen Corp said Tuesday it had been awarded a five-year, $11 million contract extension with three one-year options by Siemens Rolm Communications for facilities maintenance at Siemens Rolm's Santa Clara, Calif., headquarters.</p>
<p>The extension will bring the total value of services provided since 1991 to $48 million.</p>
<p>Siemens Rolm is a unit of Siemens AG.</p>
